!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/fixtures/declared-host.tn"
!!meta:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/meta.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/2026/39/m/core.tn"
@doc:"""
  A `declared` position: core's instance of meta's `declared_type`, whose value names its own type by
  its tag, a type of the governing closure, and is read in full against it. `note` and `memo` are two
  such types, so a vector can show the value choosing; `closed` is an ordinary field beside the two
  `declared` ones.
  """
{
  note => {
    body: text
  }

  memo => {
    to:   text
    body: text
  }

  envelope => {
    local:  declared
    other:  declared
    closed: int32
  }
}
